&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4354147&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606960336&quot; alt=&quot;Simon Arran&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4354147)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simon-arran&quot;  &gt;Simon Arran&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;、&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-bottle&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4744915&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606960336&quot; alt=&quot;Dr Bottle&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4744915)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-bottle&quot;  &gt;Dr Bottle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;与&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/df-thirteen&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4011450&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606960336&quot; alt=&quot;DF-thirteen&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4011450)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/df-thirteen&quot;  &gt;DF-thirteen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，以及参赛作品&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/three-cubic-thousand-worlds-burned-into-ashes&quot;&gt;三千世界，只在眼下 红莲业火，燔烬须弥&lt;/a&gt;；&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3317001&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606960336&quot; alt=&quot;W Asriel&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3317001)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/w-asriel&quot;  &gt;W Asriel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，以及参赛作品&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-sun-also-rises&quot;&gt;太阳照常升起&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
敬请阅览！&lt;/p&gt;
